                <h1 class="fs-40 fw-8 secondary-text">Building Digital Experiences to <span>Empower Indigenous Businesses</span> </h1>
                <div class="primary-text">
                    <p>We are an Indigenous-owned technology company delivering AI, web, mobile, cloud, and ERP solutions inspired by cultural values, community, sustainability, and innovation.</p>
                    <ul class="p-0 list-style-none m-0 d-flex flex-column gap-6">
                        <li class="d-flex align-center gap-10">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 15 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <circle cx="3.378" cy="5.98737" r="3.378" fill="#339E9D"/>
                                <path d="M14.5859 5.98606L4.21875 11.9721L9.11342 5.98606L4.21875 0L14.5859 5.98606Z" fill="#339E9D"/>
                            </svg>
                            Indigenous values guide every technology solution we create.
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-center gap-10">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 15 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <circle cx="3.378" cy="5.98737" r="3.378" fill="#339E9D"/>
                                <path d="M14.5859 5.98606L4.21875 11.9721L9.11342 5.98606L4.21875 0L14.5859 5.98606Z" fill="#339E9D"/>
                            </svg>
                            Scalable digital solutions built around your business needs.
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-center gap-10">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 15 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <circle cx="3.378" cy="5.98737" r="3.378" fill="#339E9D"/>
                                <path d="M14.5859 5.98606L4.21875 11.9721L9.11342 5.98606L4.21875 0L14.5859 5.98606Z" fill="#339E9D"/>
                            </svg>
                            Community focused innovation that creates lasting business value.
                        </li>
                        <li class="d-flex align-center gap-10">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 15 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <circle cx="3.378" cy="5.98737" r="3.378" fill="#339E9D"/>
                                <path d="M14.5859 5.98606L4.21875 11.9721L9.11342 5.98606L4.21875 0L14.5859 5.98606Z" fill="#339E9D"/>
                            </svg>
                            Sustainable technology designed for growth and future opportunities.
                        </li>
