<section class="icecold-bg">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mw-8 m-auto mb-30">
            <h2 class="fs-38 fw-7 black-text mb-10">Proud to Be Part of <span class="secondary-span"> Canada’s Indigenous Business Community</span> </h2>
            <p> Our recognition and certification reflect our commitment to building meaningful relationships, creating opportunities, and delivering technology solutions that make an impact. </p>
        </div>
        <div class="certification-cards">
            <div class="certification-card">
                <div class="certification-logo">
                    <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CCIB-Member.webp" alt="Canadian Council for Indigenous Business">
                </div>
                <div class="certification-line"></div>
                <p>A proud member of the Canadian Council for Indigenous Business <span>(CCIB)</span>. </p>
            </div>
